// yktk3.exe's icon, the same as the launcher's (tools/launcher/icon.ico: a baseball on the infield, the "3" badge).
// GLFW (raylib's window) loads the resource named GLFW_ICON for the window and the taskbar; Explorer and the desktop
// shortcut the launcher makes show the first icon of the file, this one.
GLFW_ICON ICON "urban.ico"
